#----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# kingbase_oracle_type.dat
#    KingbaseES Oracle-compatible type metadata overlay.
#
# Shared PostgreSQL wire types are selected in type_gen.rs. This file records
# the fixed registrations added by KbConnection for Oracle mode. ORACLE_RAW is
# intentionally absent: JDBC resolves its OID from pg_type at connection time.
#----------------------------------------------------------------------

